1
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:05,240
Kyouka, I want to borrow Yuki.

2
00:00:06,560 --> 00:00:09,777
I think we should know what my
slave form is like, shouldn't we?

3
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:11,860
You couldn't handle rewarding him.

4
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,195
Don't worry about it.

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,117
Bring it on!

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,580
I've made up my mind!

7
00:00:19,900 --> 00:00:22,160
I want more weapons in my arsenal!

8
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:26,140
Good point.

9
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,440
Judging by her behavior in default form,

10
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:34,744
Kusetsu was most likely a newborn
amongst the eight thunder gods.

11
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:39,558
It's safe to assume that the remaining
gods are stronger than she was.

12
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,660
Lives are at stake here.

13
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:46,940
Yuki, we need to be as strong as possible.

14
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:48,370
Right.

15
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:55,457
The reason my life is this way?

16
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,320
I know is all because of you.

17
00:00:58,380 --> 00:00:59,840
Those were your words!

18
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:04,300
So I'm okay with this.

19
00:01:06,560 --> 00:01:08,620
I want Mato to borrow you?

20
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:10,730
Mato?

21
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:11,970
Got it!

22
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:27,337
He can change into something like that.

23
00:01:27,420 --> 00:01:30,820
It makes sense. Right. Up my alley!

24
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:34,797
All right. Yuki.

25
00:01:34,880 --> 00:01:36,860
Let's go for a ride.

26
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:54,320
You good down there? Yeah!

27
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:56,080
This speed is great!

28
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:59,260
The breeze in Mato isn't so bad, huh?

29
00:02:00,340 --> 00:02:03,222
I've always thought
motorcycles were really cool.

30
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:12,516
I wanted to learn how to ride one so
I could take a girl out on a date.

31
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:22,060
Now that you've warmed up, let's see, what
kind of tricks you've got up your sleeve?

32
00:02:33,420 --> 00:02:34,840
A crew of Chugi!

33
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:38,700
Seems like they're not fans
of the noise, are they?

34
00:02:39,340 --> 00:02:40,900
Take these guys out!

35
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,580
Let's rest things up a bit!

36
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:55,140
Run him over, Yuki!

37
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,340
A one-hit kill!

38
00:03:06,740 --> 00:03:08,240
You holding up okay?

39
00:03:08,480 --> 00:03:09,480
I can keep going!

40
00:03:11,260 --> 00:03:12,090
Nice!

41
00:03:12,173 --> 00:03:14,055
Then let's patrol the second squadron!

42
00:03:14,700 --> 00:03:15,530
Yes, ma 'am!

43
00:03:29,780 --> 00:03:31,956
You held out all the way to the dorm!

44
00:03:32,740 --> 00:03:36,137
We can flush our enemies out
of hiding with all the noise!

45
00:03:36,220 --> 00:03:37,497
It's strong and durable, too!

46
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:39,600
Oh, not too shabby.

47
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,245
Let's take a break in the car.

48
00:03:48,980 --> 00:03:52,920
I guess it's time for
your reward to begin.

49
00:03:56,980 --> 00:03:58,340
So this is it?

50
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,840
What kind of a reward is this?

51
00:04:04,220 --> 00:04:06,437
It feels like a date.

52
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:15,957
Oh yeah,

53
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,877
this isn't so bad after all.

54
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:23,237
Here, uh, thank you that's so nice.

55
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:26,900
Wait, why did I hand him my drink?

56
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:34,217
This is almost like an indirect kiss.

57
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:36,017
How is this happening?

58
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:38,980
Let, let me have yours.

59
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:59,420
This is really kicking my ass!

60
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:06,780
That was a piece of cake.

61
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:18,160
I guess there's still more to it, huh?

62
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,875
Are you feeling okay?

63
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,880
I'm fine, goddammit!

64
00:05:25,620 --> 00:05:27,377
Are we really doing this?

65
00:05:27,460 --> 00:05:31,480
I can't believe I'm
letting a man see me naked!

66
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:38,820
I'll give you a real kiss, Yuki.

67
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:55,237
If I go this far,

68
00:05:55,320 --> 00:06:01,540
I have to accept the consequences.

69
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,475
Well, I'm glad Mato is feeling better.

70
00:06:19,780 --> 00:06:20,610
I…

71
00:06:20,693 --> 00:06:23,144
I wonder how my sister
and the others are doing.

72
00:06:23,960 --> 00:06:24,790
Huh?

73
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:27,190
Miss Tenka?

74
00:06:27,273 --> 00:06:28,340
Shhh!

75
00:06:31,180 --> 00:06:32,380
Uh...

76
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,560
Hmm...

77
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:48,010
Huh?

78
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,900
There he is!

79
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:54,100
Big sis! Coco! Nan!

80
00:07:04,540 --> 00:07:08,187
I love that I can feel my little
brother's strength returning.

81
00:07:08,500 --> 00:07:10,500
I'm so glad you're safe and sound.

82
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:14,100
Getting to Yokohama and back
was easy thanks to Tenka.

83
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:15,750
What?

84
00:07:15,833 --> 00:07:17,577
What do you mean there and back?

85
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:18,954
You brought her there?

86
00:07:19,680 --> 00:07:23,417
I had a feeling when I discovered that
our enemy could face through matter.

87
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:27,029
I figured Alba and her friends
were probably linked somehow.

88
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:31,600
And boy, she hit the nail on the head.

89
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:36,647
Tenka's been bringing us all
sorts of goodies for a while now.

90
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:38,300
I had no idea.

91
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:43,940
Flying solo is usually the best way to
minimize the risk involved. That's why.

92
00:07:44,220 --> 00:07:48,691
I did it this way because I knew that
you'd be worried for their well-being.

93
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:52,920
Nice one, Tenka!

94
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:58,340
Thank you so much, Ms. Tenka!

95
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:02,501
It's important to always
look out for one another.

96
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:09,300
We owe you a big thank
you as well, so thank you!

97
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:10,620
Thank you, Yuki.

98
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,840
Oh, it wasn't me.

99
00:08:13,100 --> 00:08:14,397
If anything, it was all Ms.

100
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:15,310
Kyoka.

101
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,740
Don't be so modest!

102
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,965
We heard about it from Aholba.

103
00:08:19,340 --> 00:08:22,105
She told us that it was
truly quite the rescue.

104
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:23,930
Magnificent?

105
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:27,610
Seriously, Ms.

106
00:08:27,693 --> 00:08:28,657
Kyouka was the real hero!

107
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:29,740
Tenka, got a sec?

108
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:34,620
Is the Demon Defense Force
going to show up on my doorstep?

109
00:08:34,900 --> 00:08:36,076
Well, at the moment,

110
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:39,037
the Defense Force is dealing
with the threat of the Eight

111
00:08:39,120 --> 00:08:42,238
Thunder Gods and their new
method of deploying Shuki.

112
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:44,264
We're pretty swamped right now.

113
00:08:44,460 --> 00:08:45,400
You'll be okay.

114
00:08:46,180 --> 00:08:49,709
I guess even your organization
has some adjustments to make.

115
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,397
We still haven't found
any leads on turning

116
00:08:52,480 --> 00:08:55,304
you and your friends back
into humans quite yet.

117
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:59,620
I'll keep trying to probe for
information on the Onmio Bureau, but...

118
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:03,393
Seems like it's going to take some time.

119
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:07,237
Might be best if we move to a
different hideout, just in case.

120
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:12,085
Right now, just having Coco and now on
back safe and sound is a five-star rating.

121
00:09:13,620 --> 00:09:16,502
Are you two feeling alright
now that you're back?

122
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:19,808
Luckily, we're not injured.

123
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,255
Just a bit lethargic.

124
00:09:21,620 --> 00:09:24,738
We've already improved a
lot since getting back here.

125
00:09:26,140 --> 00:09:28,787
Maybe there's something
I can do to help you.

126
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:42,860
You give wonderful massages.

127
00:09:53,920 --> 00:09:59,560
Their pressure points, the
ins and outs of their bodies.

128
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:04,380
Somehow, I know every part of them.

129
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:09,560
Is it because Kusetsu is inside
of me, and she was one with them?

130
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:15,830
Wow!

131
00:10:15,913 --> 00:10:17,664
I feel like a brand new person!

132
00:10:17,760 --> 00:10:18,880
Happy to hear it!

133
00:10:20,380 --> 00:10:21,757
All's well that ends well,

134
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:25,311
but I faced plenty of challenges
during the Yokohama fight.

135
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,500
I'd better lock in!

136
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:32,957
I'll see you at the next
commander's meeting.

137
00:10:33,040 --> 00:10:33,870
Good night.

138
00:10:34,020 --> 00:10:34,850
Okay.

139
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:37,020
Thanks for everything, Miss Tenka.

140
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,110
Bye.

141
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:46,590
Alba.

142
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:04,360
A bunch of Shuki raining
down on a big city?

143
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:06,736
The whole world is in a giant uproar.

144
00:11:07,060 --> 00:11:11,817
Making all those appearances, to put
everyone's mind at ease, must be very hectic.

145
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:14,280
You did a great job. Yes, indeed.

146
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,741
Perhaps you can help me
blow off some steam later.

147
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,040
Lady Ren is always busy.

148
00:11:21,260 --> 00:11:22,789
Her work truly never ends.

149
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,059
It's a young woman's game for sure.

150
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:31,000
You did good protecting the
civilians, preventing pandemonium.

151
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:35,494
The police department expressed
their gratitude as well.

152
00:11:35,740 --> 00:11:38,564
All in a day's work for
the Demon Defense Force.

153
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:41,926
However, this mission
proved a valuable point.

154
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:44,857
Commanders can have trouble
protecting the innocent.

155
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:48,037
I wish there was a way to keep
all the fights here in Mato.

156
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:50,917
Little Miss Yakumo could
join in with her full powers.

157
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:54,412
Supreme Commander, now is the
time to go on the offensive.

158
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:57,287
The level of risk to
the world has increased,

159
00:11:57,680 --> 00:12:01,017
so the Demon Defense Force
will need to shift strategies.

160
00:12:01,100 --> 00:12:05,817
That said, there's still much we lack,
including our enemy's stronghold location.

161
00:12:05,900 --> 00:12:07,660
We need to do reconnaissance.

162
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:11,737
Kuusetsu might be willing to
talk since she's inside me.

163
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:14,680
Although, she's only
appeared to me one time.

164
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:20,000
For now, I declare a state
of emergency for Mato. What?

165
00:12:20,140 --> 00:12:21,837
What exactly does that entail?

166
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:25,273
I reveal the Eight Thunder
Gods' existence to the public,

167
00:12:25,420 --> 00:12:28,917
and the Demon Defense Force pours
all its efforts into defending them.

168
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:31,977
We'll coordinate closely with
the leaders of the real world.

169
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:35,557
So we calm everyone's fears by
relaying our actions with humans?

170
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:37,169
Yes, of course, Lady Wren.

171
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:38,460
I understand.

172
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:41,340
A state of emergency.

173
00:12:42,540 --> 00:12:45,417
The eight Thunder Gods are
not to be taken lightly.

174
00:12:45,500 --> 00:12:49,477
I want you to brush up on your abilities
in preparation for the imminent attack.

175
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,390
Yes, ma 'am!

176
00:12:59,700 --> 00:13:01,060
Why do you do that?

177
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:09,700
I like it in here because
you're big and comfy cozy!

178
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:13,360
The snag is a bug in a rug!

179
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:27,180
Jouryuu, I need you to come with me.

180
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:33,074
The Eight Thunder Gods have
been summoned for a meeting.

181
00:13:37,180 --> 00:13:38,377
Shikoku, Jouryuu...

182
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:40,440
Come to greet us, Jakun.

183
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:43,820
Of course, it's my job as the youngest.

184
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:47,920
The rest are waiting inside.

185
00:13:49,940 --> 00:13:52,940
Is your research coming along well? Yes.

186
00:13:53,360 --> 00:13:55,595
There's still so much I want to learn.

187
00:13:57,140 --> 00:14:00,199
Ordinarily, I'd be hard at
work at this very moment.

188
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:03,760
If not for those Demon
Defense Force pests!

189
00:14:12,880 --> 00:14:14,320
You're very late.

190
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,877
I'm surprised you dodged that?

191
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:26,560
I figured you're moping, Lucky Rusty!

192
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:33,620
Actually, my anger is fueling my power.

193
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:38,660
That's what I call a Thunder God!

194
00:14:39,500 --> 00:14:44,160
Between the two of you, I'd say
Shikoku seems a bit more upset.

195
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,200
I am responsible for this.

196
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:49,558
I never should have let
Kusetsu go into battle alone.

197
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:55,960
Then let's annihilate those vile
humans and avenge her death.

198
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:09,600
Lady Takeoku.

199
00:15:10,180 --> 00:15:12,220
Take a knee, Shikoku.

200
00:15:14,780 --> 00:15:17,917
I trusted in you to lead on my behalf.

201
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:20,900
since I cannot leave Mother's side.

202
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:25,300
The slaughter of a god is a
massive failure on your part.

203
00:15:26,100 --> 00:15:28,860
I am horribly regretful with my decision.

204
00:15:34,220 --> 00:15:37,140
Your wounds will heal
shortly, unlike hers.

205
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:39,580
So revel in your suffering.

206
00:15:41,660 --> 00:15:45,060
Do not dwell on the thought
of Kusetsu any longer.

207
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:49,340
Thus, I have passed judgment upon you.

208
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:55,860
None of you are to chastise
her any further. Understood.

209
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,820
We never did that in the first place.

210
00:15:59,500 --> 00:16:01,912
Taikyoku was the only one chastising her.

211
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:06,360
Now then,

212
00:16:06,660 --> 00:16:09,357
normally when the eight of
us are gathered together,

213
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,499
we would have mounted an offensive.

214
00:16:12,140 --> 00:16:13,760
What's the plan, Shikoku?

215
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:17,857
The demon defense force is
stronger than I anticipated,

216
00:16:17,940 --> 00:16:20,117
which is why we should
rush the purification

217
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:22,847
day like we had planned
for after our attack.

218
00:16:23,600 --> 00:16:26,940
If we wait for purification
day, then it's open season.

219
00:16:27,740 --> 00:16:30,093
Our strength will increase dramatically.

220
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:33,904
Defeating the defense
force will be even easier.

221
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:36,250
Absurd!

222
00:16:36,333 --> 00:16:37,163
Spineless approach!

223
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:39,597
How long does it take to
get our ducks in a row?

224
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,445
I suggest you tread carefully.

225
00:16:41,980 --> 00:16:43,862
They annihilated one of our own!

226
00:16:44,020 --> 00:16:45,077
We should retaliate!

227
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:47,160
I agree with Naruhime and Rai-ren.

228
00:16:49,180 --> 00:16:51,500
All right, then how about a compromise?

229
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:57,980
We proceed with Shikoku's plan, and then
we make a move on the Demon Defense Force.

230
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:02,800
The Holy Tributes will attack them.

231
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:05,520
The Holy Tributes.

232
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,220
Former humans granted power by the gods.

233
00:17:09,080 --> 00:17:12,609
The most capable of the holy
tributes becomes a thunder god.

234
00:17:13,260 --> 00:17:16,025
They'll jump at any chance
to prove themselves.

235
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:19,240
She, too, desires godhood.

236
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:21,200
Fine by me.

237
00:17:21,500 --> 00:17:24,717
Then we'll see if she's strong
enough to stand beside us.

238
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,620
What say you, Lady Taikyoku?

239
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:29,822
I do not mind so long as
Shikoku is in agreement.

240
00:17:30,980 --> 00:17:32,039
Then it's settled.

241
00:17:32,520 --> 00:17:35,777
Riren, Fukuma, the three of us
have things to discuss later.

242
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:38,377
You look like you're
planning something big.

243
00:17:38,460 --> 00:17:41,257
Well, as the humans like
to say, go big or go home.

244
00:17:41,340 --> 00:17:42,760
Hell yeah, as we should.

245
00:17:43,200 --> 00:17:46,860
Mother wishes for at least
1,000 executions per day.

246
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:50,080
Carry out your duties with that in mind.

247
00:17:51,060 --> 00:17:55,540
Make them fall to their knees
and bow down before our might.

248
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:58,480
A state of emergency for Mato.

249
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:01,214
This is starting to get pretty serious.

250
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:03,497
The eight Thunder Gods are on the move,

251
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:06,417
and they've already reached
havoc on the real world.

252
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:09,120
As for us, things are changing now.

253
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:11,720
We need to become stronger than ever.

254
00:18:12,020 --> 00:18:14,157
What do you mean, stronger than ever?

255
00:18:14,240 --> 00:18:16,887
First, by expanding our
respective abilities.

256
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,800
Then next, by enhancing my skills.

257
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:24,017
From now on, I'll be more
proactive about lending it out.

258
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:26,520
To you all, and other commanders.

259
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:30,713
The 7th Squadron is going to
get stronger alongside Yuki.

260
00:18:31,220 --> 00:18:33,396
Don't let the Thunder Gods scare you.

261
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:36,020
We'll make them fall and bow down.

262
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:37,490
Great!

263
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:41,180
If that's the plan, Yuki, then
let's practice after this.

264
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:44,137
Himari, you've been keeping
Yuki all to yourself lately.

265
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:45,300
You have to share.

266
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,440
It's my turn now.

267
00:18:46,600 --> 00:18:48,680
Nii's ready to work hard. Sure.

268
00:18:48,940 --> 00:18:50,597
I'll train with you whenever you want.

269
00:18:50,680 --> 00:18:51,797
Name the time and place.

270
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:52,977
You really mean it?

271
00:18:53,060 --> 00:18:55,360
Then let's get going right now. Okay.

272
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:56,880
Hey, no fair!

273
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:00,867
Well, I'll take turns, okay?

274
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,790
Then I get to go next.

275
00:19:01,873 --> 00:19:03,114
He wants to train you!

276
00:19:03,580 --> 00:19:04,410
Whoa, hold on!

277
00:19:04,493 --> 00:19:05,499
Everyone, hold on!

278
00:19:08,680 --> 00:19:09,897
Good job back there.

279
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:11,540
You handled it very well.

280
00:19:11,840 --> 00:19:13,134
Thank you, Miss Kyoka.

281
00:19:14,900 --> 00:19:18,617
Practicing with Mato, reuniting
with Aoba, the commander's meeting.

282
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:21,406
Things have been hectic
since beating Kusetsu.

283
00:19:22,020 --> 00:19:23,520
Yeah, they sure have.

284
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:26,600
I feel like I could drop
at any second. I know.

285
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:28,697
Take the rest of the day off.

286
00:19:28,780 --> 00:19:30,557
That's an order as your commander.

287
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,470
Right.

288
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:33,901
Once you've had some decent rest,

289
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:38,660
do you think you'd want to
start training with me again?

290
00:19:46,420 --> 00:19:47,250
Absolutely!

291
00:19:47,333 --> 00:19:48,917
We have to get as strong as possible!

292
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:53,097
You have to surpass Commander Ren so
that you can become Supreme Commander,

293
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:54,010
Miss Kyoka!

294
00:19:55,820 --> 00:19:56,877
Very well said.

295
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,480
Now that's my partner.

296
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:02,650
I don't know what

297
00:20:02,733 --> 00:20:09,100
I'm

298
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:16,520
talking

299
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,517
about.

300
00:20:26,540 --> 00:20:28,940
Love this love.

301
00:20:30,880 --> 00:20:31,710
The love you don't.

302
00:20:31,793 --> 00:20:32,957
It doesn't.

303
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:34,420
Life.

304
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:35,850
Online.

305
00:20:35,933 --> 00:20:37,280
On the выполnce.

306
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:39,670
Melinda.

307
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:40,970
And.

308
00:20:41,053 --> 00:20:42,217
Bye. Mod. Maybe.

309
00:20:42,300 --> 00:20:44,197
Un gradual.

310
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:46,060
Why. Ms.

311
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:16,460
Love, love, follow!

312
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:19,320
A love that will change the world?

313
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:23,780
A dark time will shine with me!

314
00:21:38,540 --> 00:21:39,860
Supreme Commander!

315
00:21:40,580 --> 00:21:43,220
I had some free time so I stopped by

316
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:45,430
Kyoka?

317
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:47,197
She's with the first squadron.

318
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:49,633
She had some things to discuss with Ryu.

319
00:21:49,740 --> 00:21:50,570
Oh, darn.

320
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:52,100
I picked a bad time.

321
00:21:54,660 --> 00:21:57,380
Were you in the middle of cooking? I was.

322
00:22:05,120 --> 00:22:06,580
Time to dig in.

323
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:11,757
The Supreme Commander
eating a meal in our dorm.

324
00:22:11,840 --> 00:22:13,420
What a bizarre sight!

325
00:22:14,320 --> 00:22:15,600
It's amazing.

326
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:18,620
Even the way she eats is pretty.

327
00:22:20,960 --> 00:22:22,297
Thanks for the food.

328
00:22:22,380 --> 00:22:23,577
Oh, it was nothing.

329
00:22:23,660 --> 00:22:25,897
Oh, thank goodness!

330
00:22:25,980 --> 00:22:27,637
She ate every last bite.

331
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:29,457
It was delicious.

332
00:22:29,540 --> 00:22:32,000
A dish that evokes the season.

333
00:22:33,840 --> 00:22:35,340
Now your reward.

334
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,820
Yuki sits.

335
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:42,840
When I say sit, it means.

336
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:44,920
Like this.

337
00:22:45,860 --> 00:22:47,040
Who's a good boy?

338
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:49,280
You like that, don't you?

339
00:22:49,700 --> 00:22:51,000
What in the hell?

340
00:22:52,020 --> 00:22:53,480
Behind the ears, huh?

341
00:22:53,620 --> 00:22:55,280
Is happening right now!

342
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:00,577
This isn't the same at all.

343
00:23:00,660 --> 00:23:04,320
When Yuki Wakura's in his
human form, it's pointless.

344
00:23:10,400 --> 00:23:13,694
I have to discipline him after
his slave transformation.

345
00:23:14,080 --> 00:23:20,060
If not, it doesn't count as
payback for what he did to me.

346
00:23:21,520 --> 00:23:23,500
I'll definitely be back.

347
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:28,460
Whoa, don't panic.

348
00:23:28,820 --> 00:23:30,408
There's a bonus, I promise.

349
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:33,417
Too bad they didn't get
to see too much of us.

350
00:23:33,500 --> 00:23:36,297
I'm so relieved I didn't have
to do any special training.

351
00:23:36,380 --> 00:23:38,197
It's going to be a fierce battle.

352
00:23:38,280 --> 00:23:40,398
I expect you all to do great things.
